  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert $7654_{8}$ to base 16.",
        "zh": "将 $7654_{8}$ 转换为16进制。"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "CAF",
            "zh": "CAF"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "DBE",
            "zh": "DBE"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "EDB",
            "zh": "EDB"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "FAC",
            "zh": "FAC"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "F9C",
            "zh": "F9C"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **D**.\n\nConvert each octal digit into three bits, then regroup into four-bit hexadecimal digits.\n\n$$7654_8=111\\,110\\,101\\,100_2=1111\\,1010\\,1100_2=FAC_{16}.$$",
        "zh": "答案：**D**。\n\n八进制每位展开为三位二进制，得 `111 110 101 100`。从右向左改成四位一组：`1111 1010 1100`，分别对应 F、A、C，结果为 $FAC_{16}$。"
      },
      "source": {
