    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "What is the value of $125_{16}$ in base 10?",
        "zh": "将 $125_{16}$ 转换为10进制,其值是多少?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "69",
            "zh": "69"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "288",
            "zh": "288"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "293",
            "zh": "293"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "297",
            "zh": "297"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "338",
            "zh": "338"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\nTo convert from base 16 to base 10, multiply each digit by a power of 16.\n\n$$\n1*16^{2}+2*16+5=256+32+5=293\n$$",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n从左到右，三个十六进制位的位权分别为 $16^2$、$16$、$1$，所以 $125_{16}=1\\times256+2\\times16+5=293$。"
      },
      "source": {
