    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert $2025_{10}$ to base 8.",
        "zh": "将 $2025_{10}$ 转换为8进制。"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "3862",
            "zh": "3862"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "3751",
            "zh": "3751"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "1537",
            "zh": "1537"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "1045",
            "zh": "1045"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "253",
            "zh": "253"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **B**.\n\nTo convert $2025_{10}$ from base 10 to base 8, divide by 8 and use the remainders for the new number. 2025/ 8 = 253 r 1, 253 / 8 = 31 r 5, 31 / 8 = 3 r 7, 3 / 8 = 0 r 3 Reading backwards, the answer is 3751.",
        "zh": "答案：**B**。\n\n连续除以 8，依次得到商 253、31、3、0，余数 1、5、7、3。第一次余数是个位，逆序读得 $3751_8$。用 $3\\times512+7\\times64+5\\times8+1$ 可验回 2025。"
      },
