    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "How many 0s are there in all of the octal numbers when counting from $2025_{8}$ to $2050_{8}$, inclusive?",
        "zh": "从八进制数 $2025_8$ 数到 $2050_8$（含首尾），这些数中总共有多少个 0？"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "10",
            "zh": "10"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "12",
            "zh": "12"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "15",
            "zh": "15"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "20",
            "zh": "20"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "23",
            "zh": "23"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "E"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **E**.\n\nCount zero digits, including repeated zeros in a single numeral. The numerals 2025–2027 contribute 3. In 2030–2037, each of the eight numerals has a zero in the $8^2$ place, and 2030 has a second zero. That contributes 9. The 2040–2047 block contributes another 9 by the same reasoning. The endpoint 2050 contributes 2. Total: $3+9+9+2=23$.",
        "zh": "答案：**E**。\n\n题目问的是数字 0 出现了多少次，同一个数里有两个 0 就要计两次。2025 至 2027 共 3 个；2030 至 2037 的八个数各有一个 0 在 $8^2$ 位，2030 的个位还有一个，共 9 个；2040 至 2047 同样共 9 个；末尾 2050 有 2 个。所以总数为 $3+9+9+2=23$。"
      },
