    {
      "id": "q5",
      "number": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Blending two colors is done by finding the average of each component. Given the two colors #B058C3 and #9864AE, what is the blended green component? Express this in base 10.",
        "zh": "通过计算两种颜色中每个分量的平均值来实现颜色混合,给定两种颜色#B058C3和#9864AE,混合后绿色的分量是多少?(用10进制来表示结果)"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "92",
            "zh": "92"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "93",
            "zh": "93"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "94",
            "zh": "94"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "95",
            "zh": "95"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "96",
            "zh": "96"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\n58 and 64 are the green components. In base 10, 5*16+8=88 and 6*16+4=100 so (88+100)/2=94. Without doing any math, counting from 58 to 64 in hex is 58, 59, 5A, 5B, 5C, 5D, 5E, 5F, 60, 61, 62, 63, 64. The one in the middle is $5E_{16}$ = 5 * 16 + 14 = $94_{10}.$",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n提取中间两位作为绿色值。$58_{16}=5\\times16+8=88$，$64_{16}=6\\times16+4=100$，平均值是 $(88+100)/2=94$。题目要求十进制，虽然同一数值也可写为 $5E_{16}$。"
      },
