    {
      "id": "q6",
      "number": 6,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Making a color lighter is done by adding some number to each component. Similarly, making a color darker is done by subtracting some number from each component. What is the color created by subtracting $A_{16}$ from each component of #B9784F?",
        "zh": "通过向每个颜色分量添加一个数值,可以使颜色变浅。类似地,通过从每个颜色分量减去一个数值,可以使颜色变深。那么,从颜色#B9784F的每个分量中减去 $A_{16}$ 后,会生成什么颜色?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "AF6E45",
            "zh": "AF6E45"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "AF6845",
            "zh": "AF6845"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "AA7F45",
            "zh": "AA7F45"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "A86F45",
            "zh": "A86F45"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "A96E45",
            "zh": "A96E45"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **A**.\n\nSplit the color into the channels `B9 78 4F` and subtract $A_{16}$ from each one independently. Borrow in the first two channels, where $9<A$ and $8<A$. This gives `AF 6E 45`. The last channel needs no borrow because $F-A=5$. Rejoin the channels to obtain `AF6E45`.",
        "zh": "答案：**A**。\n\n拆成 `B9 78 4F` 三个通道，分别减去 $A_{16}$。前两组个位不够减要借位，得到 $AF_{16}$、$6E_{16}$，第三组得到 $45_{16}$。按原来的通道顺序拼为 `AF6E45`。"
      },
